@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="page-card">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

    <p>
        ABC Retail values the privacy of its customers. This application stores customer profile
        information (such as name, email, and address) in Azure Table Storage, and this data is used
        solely for the purpose of managing orders and account records.
    </p>

    <p>
        Product images are stored securely in Azure Blob Storage and served directly to authenticated
        users of this application. Order activity is processed asynchronously via Azure Queue Storage,
        and system activity logs are stored in Azure Files for operational monitoring and troubleshooting
        purposes only.
    </p>

    <p>
        No customer data is shared with third parties. Data is retained only as long as necessary to
        provide the services described above.
    </p>
</div>